# qemu with KVM or TCG and SeaBIOS; OVMF with Secure Boot; the Microsoft-signed Fedora
# shim; ukify and the systemd stub for the UKI, sbsign to sign it; virt-firmware to write
# the MOK into the varstore; busybox (static) and bpftool for the test initramfs;
# e2fsprogs for the ext4 rootfs of the guest kernel; realtime-tests (hackbench), fio and
# netperf for the benchmark.
qemu-system-x86-core edk2-ovmf shim-x64
systemd-ukify systemd-boot-unsigned sbsigntools python3-virt-firmware
busybox bpftool cpio zstd openssl e2fsprogs realtime-tests fio netperf
